        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A green T-Rex built from five pieces: a sphere head, oval body, two tiny capsule arms, two larger capsule legs, and a tapered cylinder tail. The comically small arms are the defining feature, so keep them short. A pale underbelly is added with a "
